I'm always proud to stand with the hard-working men and women of North Jersey labor. Unions helped build this state, this country, and create the most competitive workforce in the world.

As a member of the Labor Caucus, I'll keep fighting in Washington for lower healthcare costs, lower taxes, getting ahead of AI, and fighting for the  dignity and respect every worker has earned.

